<title>ISRAEL: Israel Chemicals Ltd Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Israel Chemicals Ltd Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel Chemicals Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96     Q3 95	9-MTH 96    9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Sales		    415	 359	  1,241	 1,036</p>
<p>Operating profit	50.8	37.4	  131.6	  86.7</p>
<p>Net Profit		17.6	 6.7	   56.8   loss 15.4</p>
<p>The company's investments in the first nine months rose to $468.5 million from $342.0 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The company attributed the substantial improvement in its results to programmes to increase efficiency, a rise in prices for most of the company's products and to the acquisition of B.K. of Germany and Clearon of the United States. The results of these acquired companies were not included in 1995 results.</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
